  "comments": "The standard weight of these coins was 105 grains.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Varieties of George VI threepence exist with either sharp or rounded corners:</span><br />\r\n1937-40 - all sharp<br />\r\n1941 - sharp or rounded<br />\r\n1942-46 - all rounded<br />\r\n1948 - sharp or rounded<br /><br />\r\n1944 dated coins were all produced at Pinewood Studios with machinery moved from London in case of bomb damage to the main site. <a href=\"https://www.royalmint.com/shop/coin-sets/The-Royal-Mint-Starter-Coins-1944-Threepence/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.royalmint.com/shop/coin-sets/The-Royal-Mint-Starter-Coins-1944-Threepence/</a>",
